@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Server health -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. List assignments -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Existing assignment -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Missing assignment -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Submit to an open assignment -> 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/SV001/rest-api"
}

### 6. Read the submission created by request 5 -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Invalid submission -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}
